{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/2891e9b4d1405cd3471d7e2fc0e656b3.poster.avif?t=1765363849\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/2891e9b4d1405cd3471d7e2fc0e656b3.webm?t=1765363849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/2891e9b4d1405cd3471d7e2fc0e656b3.mp4?t=1765363849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your inner magical girl and embark on a life-changing journey with Mirage: Miracle Quest, from Strasbourg-based indie studio Toe Bean Club!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the retro-inspired, hand-painted world of Andafy, a continent shaped by the vibrant cultures and aesthetics of Madagascar, France, and Japan. Play as Mirage, a young exorcist whose quiet life is shattered when a mysterious creature ravages her hometown, whispering her grandmother's name in its final breath. Joined by a growing cast of allies, Mirage embarks on a perilous quest to embrace her true power and unveil the darkest secrets of Andafy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique adventure modernizes classic turn-based RPG combat with deck-building inspired features that let you customize your playstyle, create powerful synergies, and approach each battle with fresh strategy. Confront formidable foes and guide tormented spirits to peace, as you explore a world brimming with challenges and wonders, all while forging your path to becoming a true exorcist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/2cea1f558b51424c3df848c4c36cca6a.avif?t=1765363849\" width=600 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/b66499c283832fd33a1aba06f2fbb010.poster.avif?t=1765363849\" width=600 height=337 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/b66499c283832fd33a1aba06f2fbb010.webm?t=1765363849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the beautiful yet conflicted continent of Andafy</strong> and explore its unique regions, each with its own culture, identity, secrets, and scars. Begin your journey through a whimsical land at odds with itself and unveil its deepest mysteries !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/13e9484a2e92141f507db5cd42019d18.avif?t=1765363849\" width=600 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/01d0937344f719b1730dd907f65d9796.poster.avif?t=1765363849\" width=600 height=337 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/01d0937344f719b1730dd907f65d9796.webm?t=1765363849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delve into a unique combat system</strong> that reinvigorates the classic turn-based rpg format and gimmicks, using deck-building features to add some chaos and a lot of synergy!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/5b3c8f992bbac01d3787664e145e1bbf.avif?t=1765363849\" width=600 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/08e38c54a48e0d0ed3c4ef578718b667.poster.avif?t=1765363849\" width=600 height=337 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/08e38c54a48e0d0ed3c4ef578718b667.webm?t=1765363849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build solid strategies</strong> around countless magic wands, accessories and spells to take the advantage in battle !\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop your skills as a magiculinary cook</strong> to craft\u00a0 exclusive and powerful items to add to your arsenal !\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your reputation as an exorcist</strong> in each area to unlock new quests, earn new wands or items and fight stronger and stronger enemies !\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838820/extras/ba4706699f450c884b61a9d7e167d043.avif?t=1765363849\" width=600 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu